  {
   "id": "unpacking-115843@post-2021-11-09",
   "gameId": "unpacking-115843",
   "displayName": "Fixes and updates",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-11-09T05:11:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This update addresses an issue that could prevent the game starting if the window had been moved to a second monitor along with some other minor issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In some cases, moving the game window to a second monitor that had a different scaling factor to the default monitor would prevent the game from restarting. Previously we were advising workarounds but this should no longer be a problem",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When VSync was disabled, the game was capable of excessive CPU usage. A maximum framerate has been set for when the game is run without vsync",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed an issue involving drawers that are above doors that could allow incorrect item placement in 2007, 2013 and 2015",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed a couple of minor visual issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Save files and progress should be unaffected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "if you have rebound your controls in a way that makes navigating the menus difficult, it's possible to reset them now from outside the game by adding",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "resetcontrols",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "to Launch Options. Remember to remove this text once you've customised your controls or they will be reset each time you start the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
